{"id":"richesse","lemma":"richesse","pos":"noun","rank":4204,"glosses":["wealth","richness"],"ipa":"/ʁi.ʃɛs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/86/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Avatea-richesse.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Avatea-richesse.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"richesses"},"formAudio":{"richesses":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-richesses.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La santé est au-dessus de la richesse.","en":"Health is above wealth.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"health"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"on"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Il doit sa richesse à la bonne fortune.","en":"He owes his wealth to good luck.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"his"},null,null,null,{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"fortune"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"Le bonheur est plus important que la richesse.","en":"Happiness is more important than wealth.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"goodhap, good fortune"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Qu'importe leur richesse, les gens veulent toujours plus.","en":"No matter how rich people are, they always want more.","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to matter","l":"importer"},{"g":"them"},null,{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"more / no longer"}]},{"text":"Malgré les richesses qu'il possède, il n'est pas content.","en":"Despite his riches, he's not contented.","words":[{"g":"despite, in spite of"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to own","l":"posséder"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"content"}]}]}